The third item is the open twin of \emph{after you edit}: the file is
changed and saved, and the PDF next to it has not moved.
Both forms are asked in both quizzes, since the closed alternatives
describe symptoms (the PDF changes by itself, the save failed) rather
than the model; the account tells us what the student takes the
relation between the two windows to be.

